{"id":"n498a85c7d4","headline":"World War 3 fear us back after US strikes in Iran?","summary":"Iran did not immediately confirm the reported US strikes, though state media reported blasts in the southern port of Bandar Abbas. The Revolutionary Guards said they downed a US drone and fired at an F-35.","why":"Iran sits on the Strait of Hormuz, a key chokepoint for global oil shipments, so military escalation there is closely watched by energy markets.","category":"geopolitics","event_type":"geopolitics","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Bandar Abbas","country":"Iran","lat":27.18,"lon":56.27,"region":"me"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/us/world-war-3-fear-us-back-after-us-strikes-in-iran/articleshow/131327925.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/us/world-war-3-fear-us-back-after-us-strikes-in-iran/articleshow/131327925.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-05-26T11:14:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"ce0bac412e17daf1","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Reports of strikes and downed drones raise fears of a wider conflict, which can lift oil prices and risk-off demand.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-05-26T11:14:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-05-26T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IR","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-tanker-ship-3140155.jpg","alt":"oil tanker ship (illustration)","credit":"adege","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/motor-tanker-cargo-ship-invest-314015